s options. The target is `null` when the value equals the","+row's current value, otherwise the value itself.","+","+TASK-6: Added 21 single-color vector drawables, `res/drawable/ic_widget_checkin_*.xml`,","+converted from lucide-static 1.59.0 (the `@lucide/svelte` version in use). Arc","+flags were normalized for Android's path parser. Custom icons:","+- yoga: from `IconYoga`.","+- water: a cup outline after `IconWater`.","+- food amount: Lucide `pizza`, which `IconPlate` draws.","+- menstruation: the droplet outline of `IconDropletFill`.","+","+TASK-7: New resources:","+- `layout/widget_check_in.xml`: header, list and message.","+- `layout/widget_check_in_row.xml`: tracker name above 6 option slots.","+- `layout/widget_check_in_preview.xml` and `drawable/widget_check_in_preview.xml`.","+- `drawable/widget_check_in_option_selected.xml`, using the new color","+  `widget_selected` in `values` and `values-night`.","+- `xml/check_in_widget_info.xml`: 4×3 target, min 250×180dp, resizable.","+","+TASK-8: Strings in `values` and `values-de/fr/es/it`. The short error state","+reuses `widget_time_tracking_failed` (\"Couldn't update\"), because the German","+`widget_action_failed` says \"Abhaken fehlgeschlagen\" (checking off failed).","+","+TASK-9: `CheckInWidgetProvider`, modeled on the time tracking provider. It has the","+same states and \"updated\"/error line, and no section titles. Every row view state","+is set explicitly: icon, tint, highlight, content description, alpha, enabled,","+fill-in and visibility. Unused slots are `GONE`. PendingIntent request codes are 7","+and 8. The kind `CHECK_IN(\"check-in\", …, \"today\")` and the manifest receiver are","+registered.","+","+TASK-10: **Not run.** This session has no JDK, Android SDK, device or emulator, so","+I could not run `./gradlew assembleDebug` or any of the manual checks. The code is","+unverified by a compiler. A human needs to build the app and do the brief's","+step 7 checks:","+- set, change and clear mood; pick a sport;","+- app-side check-in and tracker changes show up in the widget;","+- midnight reset;","+- airplane mode (revert and error state);","+- logout;","+- API 24 and 34+; light and dark;","+- next to the other two widgets.","+","+## New strings for the translator","+","+| name | en |","+|---|---|","+| `widget_check_in_name` | Check-in |","+| `widget_check_in_description` | Check in for today from your home screen |","+| `widget_check_in_option` | %1$s: %2$d of %3$d |","+| `widget_check_in_option_selected` | %1$s: %2$d of %3$d, selected |","+","+The de/fr/es/it versions were written by the developer and need review.","+"," ## Known issues / follow-ups"," ","-<!-- Anything that came up during implementation that wasn't in scope but should be tracked. -->","+- Not compiled and not checked on a device (see TASK-10).","+- Option values are assumed to be integers, as in the brief. Confirm this with the","+  API job.","+- After a successful tap, the row stays dimmed until the re-fetch arrives (the same","+  \"active\" lifecycle as the other kinds). It does not show the new value","+  optimistically.","+- The option content description uses the option's position (\"3 of 5\"), not its raw","+  value.","+- `widget_check_in_option_selected` is a fourth string, beyond the three in the","+  tasks, so screen readers announce which option is selected."]}],"originalFile":"# Implementation: check-in widget\n\nid: cup\ndeveloper:\ndate:\n\n<!-- Produced by @developer after implementation. -->\n\n## Summary\n\n<!-- What was implemented, task by task. Reference task IDs. -->\n\n## Changes\n\n<!-- List of files changed and what changed in each. -->\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups\n\n<!-- Anything that came up during implementation that wasn't in scope but should be tracked. -->\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01RNe7qf8D4ReMPZ1RK82BPv","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
